  "store": {
    "tagline": "A road trip through highway traffic",
    "category": "fun",
    "play": true,
    "platforms": [
      "macos",
      "linux"
    ],
    "actions": [
      {
        "title": "Drive",
        "description": "Up is the gas, down the brake, left and right steer; WASD too. That's the whole control.",
        "keys": "up, down, left, right"
      },
      {
        "title": "Change the view",
        "description": "Low behind the car, chase, the classic high angle, bumper, high, tower or long lens.",
        "keys": "c"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pause or carry on",
        "keys": "p"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sound on or off",
        "keys": "m"
      },
      {
        "title": "Try a Sprint again",
        "description": "From the run, the pause or the end of it.",
        "keys": "r"
      },
      {
        "title": "On the map",
        "description": "Left and right walk the road, up and down change region, Enter drives; G the garage, F Free Drive, Backspace back.",
        "keys": "enter"
      }
    ],
    "features": [
      "A road trip across five regions, from a quiet countryside morning to a night run, each with its own sky, its own car class and busier roads",
      "Sprints: about a minute to a finish line on a road that is the same every try, so it can be learned; three stars for the time, your best run beside you as a ghost, R tries again at once",
      "A duel at the end of every region against a rival driving the best line; win it for their car and the next region",
      "Handling built for feel: the car goes where your thumb says and stops where you let go, leaning and diving on its springs; every class turns in sharper, settles sooner and brakes harder",
      "Traffic with drivers: they keep their distance, brake, signal and change lanes when it's safe, placed so a lane is always open",
      "Near misses graded by the gap you left; near misses within four seconds build a combo, and a combo carries you past your top speed",
      "A garage of seventeen cars in five classes with their own engine notes: buy them as their regions open, upgrade the engine, handling and brakes, paint them any colour",
      "Free Drive: Endless, Two-Way, Time Attack and Speed Trap with any car you own, each with its leaderboard",
      "Signed in, your cash, cars and best times follow you to your other machines and play.cagdas.io"
    ],
    "screenshots": [
      {
        "file": "1-run.png",
        "caption": "196 km/h through countryside traffic in the Stinger '96, the drivers signalling and keeping their gaps",
        "cover": [
          264,
          315,
          844,
          414
        ]
      },
      {
        "file": "2-garage.png",
        "caption": "The garage: choose, paint and upgrade your car, pick the mode and place; your level, the next unlock and three missions beside it"
      },
      {
        "file": "3-night.png",
        "caption": "A night run: headlights on the road, tail lamps ahead, brake lights when a driver slows"
      },
      {
        "file": "4-twoway.png",
        "caption": "Two-Way at high noon: the oncoming side pays three times, and touching it ends the run"
      },
      {
        "file": "5-results.png",
        "caption": "The end of a run: the pay counted up line by line, the XP toward your next level, and how far each mission got"
      }
    ]
  },
